{"title":"What should I ask Chris Dixon?","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/914521757/0/marginalrevolution~What-should-I-ask-Chris-Dixon.html","date":1741589273000,"content":"<p>Yes, I will be doing a Conversation with him.  Chris is a managing partner at Andreessen-Horowitz, and has recently published <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Read-Write-Own-Building-Internet/dp/0593731395/ref=sr_1_1?crid=21RNHD59TQ9RW&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.wXapVYYha2vGJ8agD4i8EVW_RRSDBn5--G2M3bIe3WNciq78iGPYZZ2JsaQgkZesvf3chpQ6ZWUanWaTakRlrQ.a_8slXJg18a9DJLAlHOcqI9sjKrN6iou065nofYvXsA&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=chris+dixon+read+write+own&amp;qid=1741563982&amp;sprefix=chris+dixon%2Caps%2C88&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">Read Write Own: Building the Next Era of the Internet</a>.  Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chris_Dixon\" target=\"_blank\">Chris on Wikipedia</a>.  Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/cdixon?lang=en\" target=\"_blank\">Chris on Twitter</a>.  Chris has some writings <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://cdixon.org/\" target=\"_blank\">on his home page</a>.</p>\r\n<p>So what should I ask him?</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/03/what-should-i-ask-chris-dixon.html\">What should I ask Chris Dixon?</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/914521757/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/914521757/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/91452175